{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "124", "x": 0.8959551137550246, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03778813484861114, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "From the 1950s into the 1970s, O'Keeffe travelled widely, making trips to Asia, the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12334338960510077, "w": 0.8266211015014472, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Middle East, and Europe. Flying in planes inspired her last two major series – aerial", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1436641300790535, "w": 0.8267892424256871, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "views of rivers and expansive paintings of the sky viewed from just above clouds.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.16398487055300617, "w": 0.8259466923553191, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "In both series, O'Keeffe increased the size of her canvases, sometimes to mural", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.18445393154231154, "w": 0.8264608549986503, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "proportions, reflecting perhaps her newly expanded view of the world. When in", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.20477467201626426, "w": 0.8259900604107785, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "1965 she successfully translated one of her cloud motifs to a monumental canvas", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.22509541249021695, "w": 0.8261423099671786, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "measuring 6 metres in length (with the help of assistants), it was an enormous", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.24556447347952234, "w": 0.8266709286289964, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "challenge and a special feat for an artist nearing eighty years of age.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26588521395347503, "w": 0.7026561806194415, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The last two decades of the artist's life were relatively unproductive as ill health", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.29618092402021323, "w": 0.82599036798564, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and blindness hindered her ability to work. O'Keeffe died in 1986 at the age of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.31664996614882235, "w": 0.8260338385660532, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "ninety-eight, but her rich legacy of some 900 paintings has continued to attract", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33697070662277506, "w": 0.8261529725623744, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "subsequent generations of artists and art lovers who derive inspiration from these", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3572914470967278, "w": 0.8264254838895876, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "very American images.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3777605080860331, "w": 0.23512611543305054, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Questions 1-7", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4397610108367525, "w": 0.14500596336393806, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Complete the notes below.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4700443482867472, "w": 0.26798238990383466, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Choose ONE WORD ONLY from the passage for each answer.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5003029405032546, "w": 0.6115455349716206, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "The life and work of Georgia O'Keeffe", "x": 0.3230027395692906, "y": 0.5845524258702967, "w": 0.39484474287408, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "• studied art, then worked as a 1 ............ in various places in the USA", "x": 0.1185648034089137, "y": 0.6412131260185719, "w": 0.8058948106276957, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "• created drawings using 2 ............ which were exhibited in New York City", "x": 0.1185648034089137, "y": 0.6695806693857252, "w": 0.8040806315701194, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "• moved to New York and became famous for her paintings of the city's", "x": 0.1185648034089137, "y": 0.6979109440170779, "w": 0.8058948106276957, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3 ............", "x": 0.14255190043842747, "y": 0.7262413695340004, "w": 0.15666410149232246, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "• produced a series of innovative close-up paintings of 4 ............", "x": 0.1185648034089137, "y": 0.7545717196081381, "w": 0.7588948086797216, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "• went to New Mexico and was initially inspired to paint the many", "x": 0.1185648034089137, "y": 0.7829020696822757, "w": 0.6734282130013329, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "5 ............ that could be found there", "x": 0.14255190043842747, "y": 0.8112324951991984, "w": 0.45447033404577925, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "• continued to paint various features that together formed the dramatic", "x": 0.1185648034089137, "y": 0.839562845273336, "w": 0.7383345057061801, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "6 ............ of New Mexico for over forty years", "x": 0.14255190043842747, "y": 0.8677696200656081, "w": 0.5855426948253503, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "• travelled widely by plane in later years, and painted pictures of clouds and", "x": 0.1185648034089137, "y": 0.8960999701397457, "w": 0.8002171837358925, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "7 ............ seen from above", "x": 0.14255190043842747, "y": 0.9244303202138833, "w": 0.37484930113352616, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}], "source": "pdf text layer"}